cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use GIMaP in work that you publish, please cite it as below. Name the version you used:
  the export records of GIMaP write it (software_version).
type: software
title: "GIMaP: Grazing-Incidence Mapping Package"
abstract: >-
  GIMaP is a desktop application for grazing-incidence small- and wide-angle X-ray scattering
  (GISAXS, GIWAXS). It reduces detector frames to curves at the exact scattering vector,
  analyses them without AI (peak tables, orientation and crystallite size for GIWAXS; the Yoneda
  cut, the length scale 2π/q* and particle-model fits for GISAXS), fits 1D curves and in-situ series,
  finds stages and odd frames in series, and records where every number came from.
authors:
